XiaoYi is an experimental system for collecting and summarizing information supplied
by users. Its generated and retrieved content may be inaccurate, incomplete, or
outdated. It is not a substitute for a qualified clinician, and its output should
not be used as an individual diagnosis, prescription, or treatment decision.
People with urgent symptoms should seek appropriate in-person medical care.

